{{!
    @template mod_playerpuzzle/opponent_card

    The card of the opponent of the next phase, in the shop of the Lobby and of the screen between phases. It
    folds away, for the student who does not want to read it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * heading - The card's title
    * name, spriteurl, phasetext, traits - See mod_playerpuzzle/opponent_card_body

    Example context (json):
    {
        "heading": "Next opponent",
        "name": "Goblin",
        "spriteurl": "/mod/playerpuzzle/pix/opponents/goblin.webp",
        "phasetext": "Level 1, Phase 2",
        "traits": [
            {"text": "It hits 15% harder."}
        ]
    }
}}
<details class="pp-opponent-card" open>
    <summary class="pp-opponent-card-summary">{{heading}}: {{name}}</summary>
    {{> mod_playerpuzzle/opponent_card_body }}
</details>
